  "story": {
    "text": "Anne Steele tells Elinor everything Edward and Lucy said, for she heard it all by {LISTENING} at the {DOOR}. Edward means to be a {CLERGYMAN}, though they will be very {POOR}, and Lucy, ever {FAITHFUL}, will wait for him. She writes Elinor a {LETTER} to boast of it.",
